Test

Test it



scanf.c

#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;

int main() {
    scanf("%d,%d");
    return 0;
}

Use small arrays

Just like the Python x = [0] example.



scanf.c

#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;

int main() {
    int a[1], b[1];
    scanf("%d,%d", a, b);
    return 0;
}


Use as follows:

$ gcc scanf.c && ./a.out
123,456
$

Clean exit!

